@baseUrl = http://localhost:5046
@userId = {{userId}}

### 1️⃣ Create Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "street": "Via Etnea 45",
  "city": "Milo",
  "state": "CT",
  "postalCode": "95100",
  "country": "IT",
  "label": "Casa",
  "isDefault": true
}

> {% client.global.set("addressId", response.body.addressId); %}
### ✅ Saved addressId = {{addressId}}

### 2️⃣ Get Address by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/{{addressId}}

### 3️⃣ Get Default Address for User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/user/{{userId}}/default

### 4️⃣ Get All Addresses by User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/user/{{userId}}

### 5️⃣ Get Paged Addresses by User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/user/{{userId}}/paged/1/10

### 6️⃣ Update Address
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/{{addressId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "Via Roma 123",
  "city": "Zafferana Etnea",
  "state": "CT",
  "postalCode": "95019",
  "country": "IT",
  "label": "Casa Updated"
}

### 7️⃣ Set Address as Default
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/addresses/{{addressId}}/set-default
